      "id": "claim_45ace3b556c24e17bd0df2189c001c2c",
      "statement": "Hooks v2 separates client-owned events (SessionStart, UserPromptSubmit, SessionEnd, PermissionRequest, Notification) from server-owned lifecycle events (PreToolUse, PostToolUse, PostToolUseFailure, PreCompact, Stop, SubagentStart, SubagentStop), with an immutable capability specification defining matcher, timeout, output, exit-code, and aggregation policies for each event.",
